<div class="container prose">
  <p>Some clogs sit deep in the trap or lateral line, especially if “flushable” wipes or kids’ experiments are involved. We use closet augers and, when needed, camera the line to confirm whether the issue is local or farther down the stack.</p>
  <h2>Why call a plumber?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Avoid cracked porcelain from excessive force</li>
    <li>Prevent pushing a blockage into a more expensive location</li>
    <li>Identify recurring stoppages that point to sewer problems</li>
  </ul>
